OL,3,GNEWSACrowds gather ahead of King
OL,4,ACharles and Camilla officially opening
OL,5,ASenedd
OL,6,
OL,7,FKing Charles III and Queen Camilla are
OL,8,Fin Cardiff to officially open the new
OL,9,Fterm of the Senedd, Wales' parliament
OL,11,FIt is the seventh ceremonial opening of
OL,12,Fthe parliament since law-making powers
OL,13,Fwere devolved to Wales in 1999
OL,15,FThe King will take part in the ceremony
OL,16,Ffor the first time since he became
OL,17,Fmonarch
OL,19,FIt is also the first opening of a
OL,20,FSenedd term since Plaid Cymru became
OL,21,FWales' largest party and took over the
OL,22,Frunning of its government
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
